concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-country-of-origin-act-2017-sch-1-sec-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2(3) Subsections 255(1) to (4) of Schedule 2"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-2-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), the regulations:  (a) may prescribe (in relation to particular classes of goods or otherwise) processes or combinations of processes that, for the purposes of that subsection, do not have the result described in subsection (2)(b); and  (b) may include examples (in relation to particular classes of goods or otherwise) of processes or combinations of processes that, for the purposes of that subsection, have the result described in subsection (2)(b)." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), the regulations:  (a) may prescribe (in relation to particular classes of goods or otherwise) processes or combinations of processes that, for the purposes of that subsection, do not have the result described in subsection (2)(b); and  (b) may include examples (in relation to particular classes of goods or otherwise) of processes or combinations of processes that, for the purposes of that subsection, have the result described in subsection (2)(b)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eaefadb366fda0667c024317e7e9b6400e8b1f3caef0b626c55b14182f6133e9" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-country-of-origin-act-2017-sch-1-sec-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "May prescribe processes or combinations of processes for particular classes of goods." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
