doc:sch-1-sec-4-ss-9 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "4(9) Subsections 255(8) and (9) of Schedule 2" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(9) For the purposes of item 1 of the table in subsection (1) in relation to an ingredient or component, water added to the ingredient or component is treated as having the same origin as the ingredient or component, regardless of its actual origin, if:  (a) the ingredient or component has been dried or concentrated by the evaporation of water; and  (b) the added water returns the water content of the ingredient or component to no more than its natural level." ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer .

